<title>UK: Jan 7-9 Brent kept by BP - traders.</title>
<headline>Jan 7-9 Brent kept by BP - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent date nominated loading dates on Monday was kept voluntarily ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The January 7-9 Brent was kept by BP, the traders said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
